WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:00.500
It seems

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:01.401
increasingly likely

00:00:01.401 --> 00:00:03.670
that Ukraine will be getting F-16

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:04.904
fighter jets in the future.

00:00:04.904 --> 00:00:06.272
However, its military forces on

00:00:06.272 --> 00:00:08.008
the ground are also getting

00:00:08.008 --> 00:00:08.975
some upgrades.

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.043
CNN's Nic Robertson

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:11.244
reports on the new tools

00:00:11.244 --> 00:00:14.848
being added to Ukraine's arsenal.

00:00:15.882 --> 00:00:19.786
Focus on cold

00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:22.322
for three or four days

00:00:22.322 --> 00:00:25.525
in the Cold War believing alerts.

00:00:25.525 --> 00:00:25.692
In this case,

00:00:26.760 --> 00:00:28.962
these were lost probably three weeks

00:00:29.796 --> 00:00:31.064
Ukrainian troops

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:33.033
get a lesson on covert bomb

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:36.002
making of local ruble,

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:39.072
British explosives and counter

00:00:39.072 --> 00:00:40.740
insurgency specialists

00:00:40.740 --> 00:00:43.176
pass on decades of know-How

00:00:43.510 --> 00:00:44.878
to soldiers already

00:00:44.878 --> 00:00:47.781
well-versed in normal frontline combat

00:00:48.181 --> 00:00:48.882
operations.

00:00:48.882 --> 00:00:49.249
And

00:00:50.183 --> 00:00:51.317
will be.

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:57.057
But these are no ordinary bombs.

00:00:57.390 --> 00:00:57.891
They are

00:00:57.891 --> 00:01:00.160
secret weapons in Ukraine's

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:01.928
clandestine arsenal

00:01:01.928 --> 00:01:04.564
to kill Russians on Ukrainian land.

00:01:05.432 --> 00:01:06.800
If we have a high priority

00:01:06.800 --> 00:01:08.401
target, we, of course, uses

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.736
equipment against it.

00:01:11.471 --> 00:01:14.240
And it's not just individual targets.

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:16.009
Similar technology

00:01:16.009 --> 00:01:18.011
already and very experienced

00:01:18.011 --> 00:01:19.245
Ukrainian hands

00:01:19.245 --> 00:01:20.580
was used to bring down

00:01:20.580 --> 00:01:21.548
a building

00:01:21.548 --> 00:01:24.150
on dozens of Russian troops recently

00:01:24.150 --> 00:01:24.684
and back

00:01:24.684 --> 00:01:27.720
much of this equipment is used to destroy

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:28.655
the enemy

00:01:28.655 --> 00:01:30.623
who use it to produce explosive devices

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:31.291
we can use

00:01:31.291 --> 00:01:32.859
on the ground, on the battlefield

00:01:32.859 --> 00:01:35.095
or in the air as ammunition for drones.

00:01:35.962 --> 00:01:36.963
This work

00:01:37.564 --> 00:01:38.231
means

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:40.633
no

00:01:41.501 --> 00:01:42.669
restrictions

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:46.372
but it's not just the subversive

00:01:46.372 --> 00:01:48.074
skills and techniques

00:01:48.074 --> 00:01:49.642
the British experts bring

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:52.078
that are needed in undercover operations.

00:01:52.378 --> 00:01:54.647
It's the bomb components to

00:01:55.448 --> 00:01:57.617
sophisticated switches,

00:01:57.617 --> 00:01:59.552
specialized microchips,

00:01:59.552 --> 00:02:00.220
night vision

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:02.555
goggles, covert monitoring, devices,

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:06.192
even 3D printers, some relatively

00:02:06.192 --> 00:02:07.594
easy to buy outside

00:02:07.594 --> 00:02:09.896
Ukraine, are in high demand

00:02:10.330 --> 00:02:11.598
because troops here

00:02:11.598 --> 00:02:13.099
are in a race against time,

00:02:13.099 --> 00:02:14.734
against the Russians,

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:17.203
and getting them through NATO's partners

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:19.606
simply takes too long.

00:02:20.607 --> 00:02:21.841
It's hard to measure

00:02:21.841 --> 00:02:22.408
this help

00:02:22.408 --> 00:02:23.776
with words or numbers

00:02:23.776 --> 00:02:26.412
because it's a great moral support for us

00:02:26.679 --> 00:02:28.414
straight to our hearts.

00:02:28.414 --> 00:02:30.550
And we are very, very grateful

00:02:30.550 --> 00:02:31.684
for this help

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:32.819
It's a measure,

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:34.821
even on the eve of an expected

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:36.890
big counteroffensive of

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:38.424
just how much help

00:02:38.424 --> 00:02:40.527
Ukraine's military still needs.

00:02:41.060 --> 00:02:43.196
That more than a year into the war,

00:02:43.196 --> 00:02:45.331
even the smallest of components,

00:02:45.565 --> 00:02:47.800
the most modest of hands on help,

00:02:48.067 --> 00:02:50.403
is so gratefully received

00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:53.806
Nic Robertson, CNN, Eastern Ukraine.

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:55.208
A day after claiming

00:02:55.208 --> 00:02:56.209
to have taken control

00:02:56.209 --> 00:02:57.110
of the bitterly contested

00:02:57.110 --> 00:02:59.412
city back much Wagner, now chief

00:02:59.712 --> 00:03:01.080
Yevgeny Prigozhin

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:01.981
says his forces

00:03:01.981 --> 00:03:02.982
will be pulling out

00:03:02.982 --> 00:03:04.984
of Ukraine on Thursday

00:03:04.984 --> 00:03:06.152
and handover his positions

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:07.387
to the Russian military.

00:03:07.387 --> 00:03:09.355
But there's been no response yet on that

00:03:09.355 --> 00:03:11.124
from the Russian ministry of defense.

00:03:11.124 --> 00:03:12.859
Ukrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky

00:03:12.859 --> 00:03:14.861
and the Ukrainian military have disputed

00:03:14.894 --> 00:03:15.862
Faulkner's claims

00:03:17.030 --> 00:03:18.064
he achieved Grozny.

00:03:18.064 --> 00:03:18.798
I clearly

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:20.133
understand what is taking place

00:03:20.133 --> 00:03:21.000
in Beaumont,

00:03:21.000 --> 00:03:23.069
and we all clearly understand

00:03:23.069 --> 00:03:25.538
why all of that is taking place.

00:03:25.538 --> 00:03:27.240
I cannot share with you

00:03:27.240 --> 00:03:28.474
the tactical views

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:30.910
of our military of our warriors,

00:03:31.311 --> 00:03:33.179
but as of today, we can see that

00:03:33.179 --> 00:03:34.080
the country,

00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:37.383
which dozens times is bigger than we are.

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:40.053
Cannot occupy us, cannot win in this war.

00:03:40.153 --> 00:03:41.854
And we understand that a bit more.

00:03:41.854 --> 00:03:44.490
And then we will be prevailing.

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:45.825
Uh, Sebastian,

00:03:45.825 --> 00:03:47.193
following all the mixed messages

00:03:47.193 --> 00:03:47.760
for us here.

00:03:47.760 --> 00:03:49.062
We got three different messages

00:03:49.062 --> 00:03:49.495
somewhere.

00:03:49.495 --> 00:03:51.831
Between Ukrainians and Volodymyr

00:03:51.898 --> 00:03:53.766
and the Russian Defense Ministry.

00:03:53.766 --> 00:03:54.100
Yeah.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.401
And I think

00:03:55.435 --> 00:03:56.836
Ukraine is making it clear

00:03:56.836 --> 00:03:57.971
that they don't want to hand Russia

00:03:57.971 --> 00:03:59.038
this propaganda victory.

00:03:59.038 --> 00:03:59.439
Right

00:03:59.639 --> 00:04:00.540
That after months and months

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:02.575
and fighting, Russia wants to claim

00:04:02.575 --> 00:04:03.810
some kind of victory

00:04:03.810 --> 00:04:04.477
that it can bring home

00:04:04.477 --> 00:04:05.378
to its people here.

00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:07.013
Ukraine isn't going to allow that.

00:04:07.013 --> 00:04:08.281
In terms of what Wagner is saying,

00:04:08.281 --> 00:04:09.182
that they're going to pull out on

00:04:09.182 --> 00:04:09.916
the 25th.

00:04:09.916 --> 00:04:11.050
We've seen this kind of threat

00:04:11.050 --> 00:04:11.851
from them before.

00:04:11.851 --> 00:04:12.218
They remember

00:04:12.218 --> 00:04:12.518
you remember

00:04:12.518 --> 00:04:13.686
they said just ahead of Victory Day

00:04:13.686 --> 00:04:14.554
that they were going to pull out

00:04:14.554 --> 00:04:15.221
right after

00:04:15.221 --> 00:04:16.956
that was partly because of a dispute

00:04:16.956 --> 00:04:17.457
with the minister

00:04:17.457 --> 00:04:18.591
of defense over equipment.

00:04:18.591 --> 00:04:19.292
So I think

00:04:19.292 --> 00:04:20.426
we believe that when we see it,

00:04:20.426 --> 00:04:21.361
because we know that Ukraine

00:04:21.361 --> 00:04:21.961
is still looking

00:04:21.961 --> 00:04:23.663
for an opening to move back in

00:04:23.663 --> 00:04:24.731
and take more territory.

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:25.565
They are,

00:04:25.698 --> 00:04:27.133
if anything, just holding on to

00:04:27.133 --> 00:04:28.401
a tiny bit of the town

00:04:28.401 --> 00:04:29.402
they've been trying to advance

00:04:29.402 --> 00:04:30.003
on the flanks.

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:30.336
It's clear

00:04:30.336 --> 00:04:32.071
Russia does have the upper hand there,

00:04:32.071 --> 00:04:33.139
but they are not giving up.

00:04:33.139 --> 00:04:34.307
And of course, the timing

00:04:34.307 --> 00:04:35.508
of all of these announcements,

00:04:35.508 --> 00:04:37.677
especially the Russian claim, comes

00:04:38.144 --> 00:04:39.345
as Ukraine

00:04:39.345 --> 00:04:40.413
took a major step forward

00:04:40.413 --> 00:04:42.081
towards getting those F-16s,

00:04:42.081 --> 00:04:43.116
those fighter jets

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:43.883
that it's been pushing

00:04:43.883 --> 00:04:45.051
for, for a long time.

00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:45.518
The U.S.

00:04:45.518 --> 00:04:47.320
saying that it will support training,

00:04:47.320 --> 00:04:48.421
signaling to its allies

00:04:48.421 --> 00:04:50.089
that it will allow the reexport

00:04:50.089 --> 00:04:51.391
from other countries.

00:04:51.391 --> 00:04:53.259
And I think that sort of provides

00:04:53.259 --> 00:04:54.060
a context there.

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:54.827
Let's take a listen to what

00:04:54.827 --> 00:04:55.828
Jake Sullivan, the US

00:04:55.828 --> 00:04:57.063
national security adviser,

00:04:57.063 --> 00:04:57.864
had to say about it.

00:04:59.599 --> 00:05:01.734
The United States has mobilized

00:05:01.734 --> 00:05:04.737
an exceptional effort to deliver on time

00:05:04.737 --> 00:05:05.471
and in full

00:05:05.471 --> 00:05:07.173
everything Ukraine needs

00:05:07.173 --> 00:05:08.741
to launch this counteroffensive.

00:05:08.741 --> 00:05:10.276
Now that we've done that,

00:05:10.276 --> 00:05:11.811
we can look forward

00:05:11.811 --> 00:05:13.413
to the long term capacity

00:05:13.413 --> 00:05:13.980
of Ukraine

00:05:13.980 --> 00:05:14.547
to be able

00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:15.515
to defend itself

00:05:15.515 --> 00:05:17.083
and deter Russian aggression.

00:05:17.083 --> 00:05:18.751
Fourth, generation fighter aircraft,

00:05:18.751 --> 00:05:19.652
Western fighter

00:05:19.652 --> 00:05:20.053
aircraft,

00:05:20.053 --> 00:05:22.388
F-16s are relevant to that fight.

00:05:24.390 --> 00:05:26.192
So no one's disputing the level of U.S.

00:05:26.192 --> 00:05:27.160
aid right to Ukraine.

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:27.493
It's something

00:05:27.493 --> 00:05:29.195
like $37 billion

00:05:29.195 --> 00:05:30.296
since the start of the war,

00:05:30.296 --> 00:05:31.331
which is really more than double

00:05:31.331 --> 00:05:32.865
everyone else put together.

00:05:32.865 --> 00:05:34.200
But it's the trickle effects

00:05:34.200 --> 00:05:35.068
that's controversial

00:05:35.068 --> 00:05:35.601
because Russia

00:05:35.601 --> 00:05:37.203
has also adapted its tactics.

00:05:37.203 --> 00:05:37.503
And I think

00:05:37.503 --> 00:05:38.738
if you look at the amount of time

00:05:38.738 --> 00:05:40.540
it's going to take to train an F-16,

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:41.641
even at the reduced time

00:05:41.641 --> 00:05:42.675
of a couple of months,

00:05:42.675 --> 00:05:44.010
it doesn't look like they'll be in place

00:05:44.010 --> 00:05:45.011
for this counteroffensive.

00:05:45.011 --> 00:05:45.345
And of course,

00:05:45.345 --> 00:05:46.479
that is the most important thing

00:05:46.479 --> 00:05:47.480
for Ukraine right now.

00:05:47.480 --> 00:05:47.880
Yeah.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:49.949
And also of immediate concern

00:05:49.949 --> 00:05:51.751
is, again, the Zephyr is a nuclear plant,

00:05:51.751 --> 00:05:53.686
which has had another power cut.

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:53.920
Yeah,

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:54.754
a blackout is what

00:05:54.754 --> 00:05:55.188
the Ukrainians

00:05:55.188 --> 00:05:56.389
that are calling it, the seventh

00:05:56.389 --> 00:05:57.824
since the start of the war.

00:05:57.824 --> 00:05:59.058
This means not

00:05:59.058 --> 00:06:00.393
that they've lost all their electricity,

00:06:00.393 --> 00:06:00.860
but they've lost

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:02.829
all external power supplies.

00:06:02.829 --> 00:06:04.764
Now they're relying on diesel generators,

00:06:04.764 --> 00:06:06.899
which the Ukrainian Atomic Energy Company

00:06:06.899 --> 00:06:08.668
says they've got enough fuel to run

00:06:08.668 --> 00:06:09.836
for just ten days.

00:06:09.836 --> 00:06:10.770
So in their words,

00:06:10.770 --> 00:06:12.271
the countdown has started.

00:06:12.271 --> 00:06:13.306
The UN's nuclear watchdog,

00:06:13.306 --> 00:06:14.874
the IAEA, is warning this money

00:06:14.874 --> 00:06:16.409
that this presents a major threat

00:06:16.409 --> 00:06:17.877
to nuclear safety.

00:06:17.877 --> 00:06:19.045
Obviously, you need cool

00:06:19.045 --> 00:06:20.480
you need electricity in a nuclear plant,

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.382
even when the reactors are in shutdown.

00:06:22.382 --> 00:06:23.616
Which they are now to provide

00:06:23.616 --> 00:06:25.718
cooling and other essential functions

00:06:25.718 --> 00:06:27.387
to prevent a nuclear accident.

00:06:27.387 --> 00:06:28.621
We've seen these blackouts before.

00:06:28.621 --> 00:06:29.489
As I said, Max,

00:06:29.489 --> 00:06:30.957
power has been restored

00:06:30.957 --> 00:06:32.658
in a matter of hours today.

00:06:32.658 --> 00:06:33.393
Is that we know

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:35.395
the situation in the plant is worsening.

00:06:35.395 --> 00:06:37.230
Staffing levels have been dropping.

00:06:37.230 --> 00:06:38.464
There was shelling last week

00:06:38.464 --> 00:06:39.098
near the plant,

00:06:39.098 --> 00:06:40.867
which the IAEA warned about.

00:06:40.867 --> 00:06:42.835
So there is concern about this.

00:06:42.835 --> 00:06:43.369
And of course, it

00:06:43.369 --> 00:06:44.937
is potentially on the front line of where

00:06:44.937 --> 00:06:46.172
we're going to see

00:06:46.172 --> 00:06:48.074
possibly a counter-offensive starting.

00:06:48.074 --> 00:06:48.841
Claire, thank you.

